{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91d546fd5b54686e7bb85257226033cd352242b235cdf2dddea0adf58bd41733", "ja": "（可憐のソロ曲が終わり、ステージの幕が下りた。\n客席からの大きな拍手が、鳴りやまない）", "zh": "（可怜的个人曲结束，舞台的布幕拉了下来。\n观众席传来的掌声如雷贯耳，丝毫没有停歇的迹象。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "f30b4889ed6a1c260285522994227105df0563597404afe2ffa5ee040675a0b6", "ja": "す、すごい拍手です、{$P$}さん……\n私……ど、どうしたらいいんでしょうか……？", "zh": "好、好惊人的掌声，{$P$}先生……\n我……该、该怎么办才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0d34dc04a538cfce49735787495a807b757f1d17ec4e58da1d70cf8651c6600d", "ja": "みんな、もっとステージの可憐を見ていたいんだな。\nアンコール、行けるか？", "zh": "大家一定是想再多多欣赏可怜在舞台上的风采。\n安可，你可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "528b124ce9e284e8adcebabad39212f52b189d4fec3eda19925c373fa4c38751", "ja": "そ、そんな……私なんかが、アンコールだなんて……\n{$P$}さん、か、代わりに……。", "zh": "怎、怎么会……就凭我，哪有办法安可……\n{$P$}先生，麻、麻烦你代替我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dc1573b1c84c3db399c185df0176ab5880af2824639243496a9c63a00e8b0910", "ja": "いや、俺が代わりには無理だと思うが……\n歌が無理なら、少し挨拶するだけでもいいと思うけど。", "zh": "不，我没有办法替你上台……\n就算无法唱歌，上台打个招呼也是可以的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "777eb4903356ad5d12c4f37d8c2667d813e89015260b6a732ac54cff5bc11269", "ja": "あ……アンコールは、すごく……嬉しいです……\nお礼、言いたいですけど……。", "zh": "啊……我真的很高兴……大家会喊安可……\n虽然我很想跟大家道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "c1296cbc7379d6093039987ac49051570fa50da0015a2a25c409a014b97a3a96", "ja": "そ、その前に、少しだけ……き、休憩を……\nお水、飲んでもいいですか……？", "zh": "但、但在那之前，先让我……休、休息一下……\n我可以喝点水吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4a7234837e1afb4157c0ccc9c15b6a11c45c83dbcfa9c457152875a8050a63b9", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nそれじゃ、少し落ち着いてから出ようか。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n就等你稍微平复一下再上台吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "4e53d0a56f1220211e7c5eac8cad44772518c57a22afc88d3c808aea6a6c3710", "ja": "はい……。\n……あの、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "好的……\n……那个，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1009_p", "source_sha256": "edd75d42bad236064e1b53c77650a3da3afe19e724b0cd34b4e8084f7a12add6", "ja": "なんだ？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "e7198fb5e6acec2bab8acf9923318d05b88748da2af9dd20c7e3f77f0e72dece", "ja": "わ、私……最初は、ソロで歌うって聞いて……\n怖くて、逃げ出したくて、しかたがなくて……。", "zh": "我、我……一开始听到要自己一个人唱歌的时候……\n心里真的怕得不得了，好想逃离这个地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "69ed90358c3152c705451064e8c8eeca441196f5a9b99beb6293c768348ffd42", "ja": "でも……{$P$}さんが、\nそばで、応援してくれていたから……。", "zh": "可是……因为有{$P$}先生，\n一直在身旁为我加油打气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "6f21e1331679a89532ae994c241a6b5ae833c8fb0d6f97f13e81e6b16de46e5b", "ja": "私のこと、たくさん考えてくれて……\n励ましてくれたから……が、頑張れました……。", "zh": "为了我设想这么多……\n不停在鼓励我……所、所以我才能坚持下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1013_p", "source_sha256": "02c2f91430c519e5ffa4202a1c490fabbd4b96c416a88442f6a5cc4bbfaa6539", "ja": "そうだな、一緒に頑張ってきた。\nこのアンコールが、その証明になったな。", "zh": "对啊，我们一起努力走到了现在。\n这一声声的安可，就是最好的证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "68229dd4abe2b40804bfc407aec875f2e67877965cbc37efad55efa98aabd2e8", "ja": "はい……。{$P$}さんのおかげで、\nファンの人達も……よ、喜んでくれました……。", "zh": "嗯……托{$P$}的福，\n粉丝们……也、也都看得非常尽兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "86e14e7c2c1605f03af4ccd152b0f67e8530cde962672650b55822ec1d214355", "ja": "全部、{$P$}さんのおかげです……\n本当に、ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "这全是{$P$}先生的功劳……\n真的很谢谢你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1016_p", "source_sha256": "caa0f7839a4db7cf22f253aa1a93b668177d79255b2edba6a6e19f79626063a5", "ja": "俺は、可憐が頑張る手助けをしただけだ。\nライブが成功したのは、可憐とお客さん達の力だよ。", "zh": "我就只是帮可怜提起干劲而已。\n演唱会的成功应该要归功于你和莅临的观众们才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "45b005a1e99c7b0430368c848de95e82723c2f3d03d7b89113712a92a7747821", "ja": "うう……{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "3341425d38ed09cd13f93a04cdb0e1b8b92db91bcc34f6b1ee6c0fad68caace3", "ja": "そうですよね……ファンのみなさんに、お礼の気持ちを\n伝えないと……ちゃんと歌で、気持ちを込めて……。", "zh": "你说得对……我得跟粉丝们，传达自己的谢意才行……\n用我的歌声，全心全意地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0044_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "15eb1840876014c8e563fbd75059e95c6fb938c3d4df36d9cd8f2dbb7a701e57", "ja": "わ……私、もう一度行ってきます……！\n見ていてください、{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "我……我要再登台一次……！\n请你继续看着我，{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
